[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7563.43, "timestamp": "02:06:03", "text": "樹一樣。  哇。  他把V寫得像數字3一樣。  好的，那段影片不錯。最近我的重新推薦清單中出現了這個。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7568.07, "timestamp": "02:06:08", "text": "我當時就想，「啊。」"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7576.629, "timestamp": "02:06:16", "text": "所以，我的猜測是對的，因為很久以前，Twitch上有個陌生觀眾說：「"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7585.83, "timestamp": "02:06:25", "text": "哦，你是印度人，但是你角色的膚色……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7592.87, "timestamp": "02:06:32", "text": "呃，如果我覺得你的膚色和你現實"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7595.83, "timestamp": "02:06:35", "text": "生活中的膚色不太"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7602.229, "timestamp": "02:06:42", "text": "搭，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 7603.499, "timestamp": "02:06:43", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "mhm"}]